 placed on the trailer cradle on Tinian","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFM_(Fat_Man)_unit_being_placed_on_trailer_cradle_in_front_of_Assembly_Building_%5E2_-_NARA_-_519397.tif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Little_Boy_being_raised_for_loading_into_the_Enola_Gay%27s_bomb_bay.jpg/330px-Little_Boy_being_raised_for_loading_into_the_Enola_Gay%27s_bomb_bay.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Little_Boy_being_raised_for_loading_into_the_Enola_Gay%27s_bomb_bay.jpg/330px-Little_Boy_being_raised_for_loading_into_the_Enola_Gay%27s_bomb_bay.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Little Boy being raised for loading into the Enola Gay's bomb bay","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALittle_Boy_being_raised_for_loading_into_the_Enola_Gay's_bomb_bay.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}